Description: This package includes the algorithms K-Means, K-Medoids, 
    spectral clustering, hierarchical clustering, DBSCAN and OPTICS. 
    Also included are easy to use functions to 
    - score the clusterings,
    - plot the clusterings, 
    - generate clustered test data.
